+# benchlib — small utility library used for agent benchmarking
+
+Small pure-Python utility modules used for agent benchmarking.
+
+## Modules
+
+- `calc.py` — arithmetic: add, sub, mul, div (safe division)
+- `textproc.py` — text: word_count, reverse_words, capitalize_words
+
+## Installation
+
+    pip install -e .
+
+## Testing
+
+    pytest
+
+## Known issues
+
+- `word_count` has a known bug: it splits on single spaces only, so
+  punctuation and consecutive spaces miscount it.
